# 💼 Personal Portfolio Website

A modern, responsive, and user-friendly personal portfolio website created to showcase my projects, technical skills, experience, and contact information.

The project was developed using **HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap 5, Vanilla JavaScript, and JSON**. Project information is stored in a JSON file and displayed dynamically using the JavaScript Fetch API.

