### Project Filtering

Projects can be filtered by category:

- All
- Web
- Mobile
- UI/UX
- Database
- Hardware

```javascript
const filteredProjects =
  selectedCategory === "All"
    ? allProjects
    : allProjects.filter(
        (project) => project.category === selectedCategory
      );

displayProjects(filteredProjects);
```

---

### Project Search

Users can search for projects by typing the project name.

```javascript
searchInput.addEventListener("input", function () {
  const searchValue = searchInput.value.toLowerCase().trim();

  const searchResults = allProjects.filter((project) =>
    project.title.toLowerCase().includes(searchValue)
  );

  displayProjects(searchResults);
});
```

---

### Project Details

The project ID is retrieved from the URL using `URLSearchParams`.

```javascript
const parameters = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);

const projectId = Number(parameters.get("id"));
```

The matching project is selected from the JSON data:

```javascript
const selectedProject = projects.find(
  (project) => project.id === projectId
);
```

---

### Dark and Light Mode

The selected theme is saved in `localStorage`.

```javascript
themeButton.addEventListener("click", function () {
  document.body.classList.toggle("light-mode");

  const selectedTheme = document.body.classList.contains("light-mode")
    ? "light"
    : "dark";

  localStorage.setItem("theme", selectedTheme);
});
```

The saved theme is restored when the page loads:

```javascript
const savedTheme = localStorage.getItem("theme");

if (savedTheme === "light") {
  document.body.classList.add("light-mode");
}
```

---

### Contact Form Validation

The contact form checks:

- Name is not empty
- Email is valid
- Subject is not empty
- Message is not empty

```javascript
contactForm.addEventListener("submit", function (event) {
  event.preventDefault();

  const name = nameInput.value.trim();
  const email = emailInput.value.trim();
  const subject = subjectInput.value.trim();
  const message = messageInput.value.trim();

  if (!name || !email || !subject || !message) {
    alert("Please fill in all fields.");
    return;
  }

  const emailPattern = /^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/;

  if (!emailPattern.test(email)) {
    alert("Please enter a valid email address.");
    return;
  }

  alert("Your message has been sent successfully.");
  contactForm.reset();
});
```

